WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,850
Selling some information outside the community

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,130
Private chat at the required price

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,250
Don't come here, you prostitute dog.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,040
I trade bread for your information

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,320
How much do you want

6
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,540
Ten loaves and five bottles of water

7
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,860
How much information can I exchange for?

8
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,740
Big customer, you initiate a transaction

9
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,900
I'll tell you the resource points

10
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,260
and detailed information on monsters

11
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,660
Ten loaves of bread and five bottles of water are nothing

12
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,580
Good for collecting information

13
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,970
You can even sell it and exchange it for resources.

14
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:30,210
Five hundred meters from the north gate is an abandoned city

15
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,210
Walk a kilometer or two towards Dongzhilou

16
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,250
There is a steel factory

17
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,650
There's a lot of iron in it

18
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,250
But there are five-faced monsters on the road that are sensitive to light sources.

19
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,570
Go crazy when exposed to light

20
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,930
Go to the high-rise buildings in the city center

21
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,130
Can find wood tools furniture

22
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,090
even weapons

23
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:44,410
But there are more five-faced monsters

24
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,850
There is also a very fast speed

25
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,290
An unknown monster that can kill adults in an instant

26
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:49,450
Add a friend

27
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:50,650
Give discounts in the future
